{"screen_name": "yonph2", "file": "yonph2-d11bd1", "name": "よんは", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2025749236776882176/WvGbOih8.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1382237604599398400/1741255212/1500x500", "description": "自分がやるTRPGアカウント🌻 成人済み🌻", "total_works": 6, "scraped_works": 6, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T16:52:10.826996+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T16:52:10.826996+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 6000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T16:52:10.826996+00:00"}], "correction": [{"amount": 2000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T16:52:10.826996+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 6000, "correction": 2000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 6000, "max": 6000}, "correction": {"min": 2000, "max": 2000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/yonph2", "name": "yonph2"}, {"label": "SKIMA", "url": "https://skima.jp/profile?id=197504", "name": "197504"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@yonph2/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e3dc7b1e/uploads/origins/bcf20597-b616-431f-acf5-773342e412cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e76cf7382df75d3e9416ed9c118edc8b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e3dc7b1e/uploads/origins/bcf20597-b616-431f-acf5-773342e412cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e76cf7382df75d3e9416ed9c118edc8b, https://si.imgix.net/e3dc7b1e/uploads/origins/bcf20597-b616-431f-acf5-773342e412cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47bb9b583b157ed5c6e117f949783026 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e3dc7b1e/uploads/origins/bcf20597-b616-431f-acf5-773342e412cf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01aed56849287a683e0e7d0272823fe7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、は〜ふです。\nいつもよんはさんの生活を応援しています。\n\n今回お願いしたいのは、笹木鳴さんと田中漠のコンビ、通称ばくめ〜ちゃんです。\nかねてより私はよんはさんの表現する光と闇の虜なのですが、前回、光代表としてあめねずちゃんをリクエストさせていただいたので、今回は闇代表としえばくめ〜ちゃんをお願いできればと思っております。\n\nシチュエーション等はよんはさんにお任せいたします。描きやすいように描いていただけると幸いです。\n描きにくかったらリクエスト無視してばくめ〜ちゃん以外でも何でも好きに描いてもらって大丈夫です。\n\nどうかご無理なく、お手隙の際に気軽に描いていただけると嬉しいです！\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yonph2/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bbfedc1f/uploads/origins/a571b59e-8194-4827-a059-a31594fa390b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0b0ebb3cce3a68c1276b8424b1500196", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bbfedc1f/uploads/origins/a571b59e-8194-4827-a059-a31594fa390b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0b0ebb3cce3a68c1276b8424b1500196, https://si.imgix.net/bbfedc1f/uploads/origins/a571b59e-8194-4827-a059-a31594fa390b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=db1cbaeaffe5e05d0a71c08886902166 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bbfedc1f/uploads/origins/a571b59e-8194-4827-a059-a31594fa390b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2c4285c41e3d7ec4d2288c45971a8a4a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yonph2/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/53d6c587/uploads/origins/e7fa3bc5-5c31-48ae-a545-dbcfb2b2d599?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea91ade2d7fff6ad2e8c78c5d096ef91", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53d6c587/uploads/origins/e7fa3bc5-5c31-48ae-a545-dbcfb2b2d599?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea91ade2d7fff6ad2e8c78c5d096ef91, https://si.imgix.net/53d6c587/uploads/origins/e7fa3bc5-5c31-48ae-a545-dbcfb2b2d599?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fba9472ce3eb5c5c591d8254a5f977e8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53d6c587/uploads/origins/e7fa3bc5-5c31-48ae-a545-dbcfb2b2d599?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d192eeccdf801379769d423c9a124df8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you very much for your help, Kairi.\nI really love your illustrations, which I see on a daily basis, and they are really attractive.\nI have been waiting for an opportunity to make a request!\nPlease let me make a request, thank you very much.\n\nRequests\n　I would like you to draw a Vtuber illustration of Kairi Sunatou, which I use in my delivery activities.\n　I will leave the pose and composition to you. It does not matter if she is not facing the front as long as her gaze is in front of you.\n　The facial expression should be a little smile.\n　For the design, please refer to the image at the URL of the document.\n\nUsage\n　 We would like to use the image as a thumbnail on YouTube and on social networking sites.\n　Therefore, we would appreciate it if the head and left and right sides of the image are not obscured.\n　If possible, we would appreciate it if you could make the background transparent.\n\n　Thank you in advance.\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/g55vb2tz45n2y0fqviiw1/h?rlkey=3dv2haz46pluufzzpe34znyit&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yonph2/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff45691d1542872aeda8371a362dbf66", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff45691d1542872aeda8371a362dbf66, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=457cadeea1359ebe0c7480d06c383f6f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7c50a0d/uploads/origins/14123a94-6f8d-4a69-93ea-2968bfc0e276?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb94da278eb30236f1cedfa2386d693c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Yonha! I'm glad to hear that skeb is now open! Please excuse my request...!\n\nIf you don't mind, I'd like to have Koji-kun and Yamato...! I would like to leave everything to you, including the composition of the illustration! I would be most happy if you could draw them as you like...!\nLastly, I wish you a long and healthy life...! I hope you have a long and healthy life!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yonph2/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a409571db314bab112f8e3dc8f0d76ba", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a409571db314bab112f8e3dc8f0d76ba, https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95e76b10569d299cca7155db45e6fc9e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2760fe91/uploads/origins/1e1fdd04-7cfb-4930-947b-acc51653bae8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=234e34970c9f02ff878e0dc7bfd52aae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, my name is HALF.\nI always support Yonha's life.\n\nWhat I would like to request this time is an illustration of a TRPG self-seeker.\n\nhttps://iachara.com/view/2611507\nThe character is called Tadara Fujinmu, and he is going through VOID at HO3.\nHe is a loose uncle with a helter-skelter atmosphere at first glance, but he always lives with anxiety in his heart.\nHe fears more than anything else that his friends are in danger.\n\nWe asked Yonha to create this character because we thought that his aesthetic and decadent atmosphere would be a good match with the inner life of Fujinushi.\n\nReally, if it is possible, I would be happy if Mr. Yonha's searcher, Goedo Ameirin, could be there as well.\n\nThe content of the picture is completely up to you.\n\nI know I've messed up, but I love all of your illustrations, so there is no problem at all if you ignore everything I've said so far and draw whatever you want.\n\nI would appreciate it if you could respond to my request when you are free.\n\nI love Yonha's drawings. ！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！！\n\nhttps://iachara.com/view/2611507", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yonph2/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b93cd1a9/uploads/origins/7ab4b15a-8ad6-4e9b-806d-7d55e2fede29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=817c0a43c33c2c2601fe71ac50295548", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b93cd1a9/uploads/origins/7ab4b15a-8ad6-4e9b-806d-7d55e2fede29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=817c0a43c33c2c2601fe71ac50295548, https://si.imgix.net/b93cd1a9/uploads/origins/7ab4b15a-8ad6-4e9b-806d-7d55e2fede29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e223eb3ef007dd61a4e83bf2d1449f8f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b93cd1a9/uploads/origins/7ab4b15a-8ad6-4e9b-806d-7d55e2fede29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9bb5a